Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":27,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":1194,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1895585,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282027.jpg?_r=1429713632","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1430965820,"LastPoster":{"Id":282047,"Name":"dathotgal","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282047.jpg?_r=1434497827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1895585,"PostDate":1430966040,"PostContent":"Hello Brides!! \u00a0 I am terrible at making decisions which has made it extremely difficult for me t...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"millar_devon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423329313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282027.jpg?_r=1429713632","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Victoriabride","Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4021bfc81469af807688425627021d02","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Brides!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am terrible at making decisions which has made it extremely difficult for me to choose a dress and I only have 9 months until my wedding day. I have narrowed it down to two dresses, but am having a tough time picking one as I love them both :wacko:. I am leaning towards the dress with the fuller ruffled skirt as I think it will look beautiful on the beach and I love the lace detailing. But, I love the other one too. I think it may be more flattering on me&amp;nbsp;the material is&amp;nbsp;much lighter which will be more comfortable in the heat. I am wondering if it is too plain for my personality though. I have asked a few friends and they all have different opinions which makes it even harder! I would love some input and any advice you may have so I can make a decision soon!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;The pictures are so small and I don&#039;t know how to make them larger :huh:?!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":32040,"Name":"Dress number 1.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282027-0-46304500-1430965357.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282027-0-46304500-1430965357_thumb.jpg","Width":89,"Height":158},{"Id":32041,"Name":"Dress Number2.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282027-0-57920400-1430965367.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282027-0-57920400-1430965367_thumb.png","Width":89,"Height":160}],"Id":1895585,"PostDate":1430966040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Brides!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am terrible at making decisions which has made it extremely difficult for me to choose a dress and I only have 9 months until my wedding day. I have narrowed it down to two dresses, but am having a tough time picking one as I love them both <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>. I am leaning towards the dress with the fuller ruffled skirt as I think it will look beautiful on the beach and I love the lace detailing. But, I love the other one too. I think it may be more flattering on me\u00a0the material is\u00a0much lighter which will be more comfortable in the heat. I am wondering if it is too plain for my personality though. I have asked a few friends and they all have different opinions which makes it even harder! I would love some input and any advice you may have so I can make a decision soon!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much<\/p>\n<br \/><p>The pictures are so small and I don't know how to make them larger <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/huh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':huh:' \/>?!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"millar_devon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423329313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282027.jpg?_r=1429713632","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Victoriabride","Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.157.76.188","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bc91cc0078f58c1ce4d7d81af1ff5cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hmmmm. maybe you uploaded the smallest version of the picture. &amp;nbsp;Try to upload the photos and save them to biggest size. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to see them!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895586,"PostDate":1430966254,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hmmmm. maybe you uploaded the smallest version of the picture. \u00a0Try to upload the photos and save them to biggest size. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to see them!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20150620\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f3ff\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396982852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"