t most 5 guests besides bride and groom. Are there any hotels that offer complimentary small ceremonies? Our good friend will be the officiant, so all I realLy need is a nice place on the beach and some cake\/wine for afterwards. &amp;nbsp;I have looked at many wedding packages, and they are in the 2,000 plus range which is totally out of my budget and they are for larger parties. All suggestions are appreciated as I have never been to Cabo.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898043,"PostDate":1433690796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am trying to plan a very small destination wedding with at most 5 guests besides bride and groom. Are there any hotels that offer complimentary small ceremonies? Our good friend will be the officiant, so all I realLy need is a nice place on the beach and some cake\/wine for afterwards. \u00a0I have looked at many wedding packages, and they are in the 2,000 plus range which is totally out of my budget and they are for larger parties. All suggestions are appreciated as I have never been to Cabo.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiecollette@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.121.164.248","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433690458,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283423.jpg?_r=1434501499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"jackiecollette","Id":283423,"Name":"jackiecollette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddre