sen a different resort.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"So far 41 guests + bride and groom + 10 kids = 95 room nights.    Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78519,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf80782296d9c8a36152a7402390089b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;April 2016 here and starting to plan now.. most likely sending out our save the dates in early 2015 so that we can give everyone enough time to plan and save :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are thinking Beach Palace in Cancun, Mexico.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881335,"PostDate":1419972153,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>April 2016 here and starting to plan now.. most likely sending out our save the dates in early 2015 so that we can give everyone enough time to plan and save <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are thinking Beach Palace in Cancun, Mexico.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78519,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55ef936ced30c4e0c3047f4b140329ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My wedding was booked at Moon Palace in September. I think we sent save the dates in November, I cant remember. I&#039;m planning to send invites out in June. Hoping that they will get them exactly 1 year before the wedding date.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881336,"PostDate":1419972716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My wedding was booked at Moon Palace in September. I think we sent save the dates in November, I cant remember. I'm planning to send invites out in June. Hoping that they will get them exactly 1 year before the wedding date.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"So far 41 guests + bride and groom + 10 kids = 95 room nights.    Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.106.6.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78519,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16df8a5d54403c3b8ce27341de34a4af","RawContent":"I&#039;m June 2016 too!!!  Except I&#039;m going to Excellence Playa Mujeres.\nThe only thing I really have done at this point is my wedding website. I&#039;ll send a link to the website in January\/ February 2015 ( need to meet with travel agent again before the site is launched) and invitations in June, so they will have it a year in advance.\n\n\nI&#039;m trying to think of all of the paper goods I need. Any suggestions in addition to:\n\n -save the date,\n\n -invitation,\n\n -welcome to Mexico letter ( if I get crafty I&#039;ll do a passport book &amp;lt;-- started)\n\n-Luggage tags\n\n-Seating chart\n\n-What to pack check list ( for guest &amp;lt;-- done!! \u263a)\n\n-what I need to pack list\n\n-Door hangers\n\n-Tip card holders to use at the resort ( clear pocket with a coil wrist key thingy &amp;lt;-- I&#039;m still undecided on this project, others on this site have said they were used often by guest)\n\n-oot bag stuff\n\n-shoes optional sign ( not sure about this)\n\n-sign for guest book ( doing post cards and at home reception having everyone write on shells)","Attachments":[],"Id":1881367,"PostDate":1420034929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm June 2016 too!!!  Except I'm going to Excellence Playa Mujeres.<br \/>The only thing I really have done at this point is my wedding website. I'll send a link to the website in January\/ February 2015 ( need to meet with travel agent again before the site is launched) and invitations in June, so they will have it a year in advance.<br><br>\nI'm trying to think of all of the paper goods I need. Any suggestions in addition to:<br>\n -save the date,<br>\n -invitation,<br>\n -welcome to Mexico letter ( if I get crafty I'll do a passport book <-- started)<br>\n-Luggage tags<br>\n-Seating chart<br>\n-What to pack check list ( for guest <-- done!! \u263a)<br>\n-what I need to pack list<br>\n-Door hangers<br>\n-Tip card holders to use at the resort ( clear pocket with a coil wrist key thingy <-- I'm still undecided on this project, others on this site have said they were used often by guest)<br>\n-oot bag stuff<br>\n-shoes optional sign ( not sure about this)<br>\n-sign for guest book ( doing post cards and at home reception having everyone write on shells)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarajenkins@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"174.106.6.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408622600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Surfingsara","Id":279511,"Name":"Surfingsara","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78519,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60c13842af3a2d2985e7d1dbaff51a7f","RawContent":"I&#039;m February 2016 and a major planner... We already have over 80 people booked, our photographer, mariachi and venues reserved, our website up and running, our invites long since mailed and our OOT bags well under way. Next steps, ordering my dress!","Attachments":[],"Id":1881368,"PostDate":1420035662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm February 2016 and a major planner... We already have over 80 people booked, our photographer, mariachi and venues reserved, our website up and running, our invites long since mailed and our OOT bags well under way. Next steps, ordering my dress! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.106.6.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78519,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfcb747e4fb292dbc58a958dc29ba558","RawContent":"Oh I also have my dress! I actually got it before I got my ring.\n\n\nMy dress kinda found me. I was procrastinating one day and looking on websites to narrow down what I liked and didn&#039;t like. Then I came across MY dress. I couldn&#039;t get my mind off of it and told my finance about it. He suggested I contact the seller ( dress was on preownedweddingdress.com) I did, and the price was right. When I heard back about the final price the next morning  i also learned that my best friend growing up, unexpectedly passed away. This dress became something positive to think about during a difficult time. When the dress arrived it fit!!! No alterations needed!!! How lucky is this? The designer only made so many of this dress and now suggest for people to find it used if they want it. They will even help you find a used one if you need them too, that&#039;s how popular this dress is\/was.\n\n\nI had been concerned about who I would take with me dress shopping and the drama that can go along with this. Plus, I was afraid I would fall in love with something I couldn&#039;t afford. ( i just cant justify spending thousands on a dress to wear one day) So buying online, this way, turned out to help out in many ways. I still can&#039;t believe it fits perfectly!\n\n\nFor me, finding shoes may be my hardest thing! I love pretty shoes, but i don&#039;t want to pay a crazy amount for them. Plus i&#039;m a former quadraphonic, ( now walking with just one forearm crutch \u263a) so I have to be careful about heals. I&#039;ve fallen in love with a few pairs of shoes on Pinterest  but when I saw they are 3+ inch heals and over $2,000, I decided I wouldnt be getting them! \n\nI&#039;ve also been considering a flat  Tommy Bahama starfish shoe. Its more reasonably priced and in the reviews people say they are comfortable and wear them all the time, even after the wedding. ( I&#039;ll try and find a photo to post later)\n\n\nIs anyone else struggling to find shoes?","Attachments":[],"Id":1881371,"PostDate":1420038220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh I also have my dress! I actually got it before I got my ring.<br><br>\nMy dress kinda found me. I was procrastinating one day and looking on websites to narrow down what I liked and didn't like. Then I came across MY dress. I couldn't get my mind off of it and told my finance about it. He suggested I contact the seller ( dress was on preownedweddingdress.com) I did, and the price was right. When I heard back about the final price the next morning  i also learned that my best friend growing up, unexpectedly passed away. This dress became something positive to think about during a difficult time. When the dress arrived it fit!!! No alterations needed!!! How lucky is this? The designer only made so many of this dress and now suggest for people to find it used if they want it. They will even help you find a used one if you need them too, that's how popular this dress is\/was.<br><br>\nI had been concerned about who I would take with me dress shopping and the drama that can go along with this. Plus, I was afraid I would fall in love with something I couldn't afford. ( i just cant justify spending thousands on a dress to wear one day) So buying online, this way, turned out to help out in many ways. I still can't believe it fits perfectly!<br><br>\nFor me, finding shoes may be my hardest thing! I love pretty shoes, but i don't want to pay a crazy amount for them. Plus i'm a former quadraphonic, ( now walking with just one forearm crutch \u263a) so I have to be careful about heals. I've fallen in love with a few pairs of shoes on Pinterest  but when I saw they are 3+ inch heals and over $2,000, I decided I wouldnt be getting them! <br>\nI've also been considering a flat  Tommy Bahama starfish shoe. Its more reasonably priced and in the reviews people say they are comfortable and wear them all the time, even after the wedding. ( I'll try and find a photo to post later)<br><br>\nIs anyone else struggling to find shoes?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarajenkins@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"174.106.6.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408622600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Surfingsara","Id":279511,"Name":"Surfingsara","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.43.233.7","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78519,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"38a34c02619c6f72003642cab353d0ec","RawContent":"I uhm, bought like 4 pairs of shoes for my wedding. It was definitely the most difficult decision for me - and I LOVE shoes. serious shoe addict here...\n\nI ended up wearing a Stuart Weitzman wedge for the ceremony and sequin TOMS for my reception\/dancing. worked out just fine.  \n\n[quote name=\"Surfingsara\" post=\"1881371\" timestamp=\"1420038220\"]\n\nIs anyone else struggling to find shoes?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1881408,"PostDate":1420055846,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I uhm, bought like 4 pairs of shoes for my wedding. It was definitely the most difficult decision for me - and I LOVE shoes. serious shoe addict here...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I ended up wearing a Stuart Weitzman wedge for the ceremony and sequin TOMS for my reception\/dancing. worked out just fine. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Surfingsara, on 31 December 2014 - 07:03 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><br>\nIs anyone else struggling to find shoes?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309657880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78519,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4299ac05099164702bbc45b2e262f4bb","RawContent":"January 23, 2016 bride \u263a\n\n\n@[member=\"TheBHolders\"], why have you been second guessing your resort? As a fellow Moon Palace bride, I&#039;m here if you need to vent about anything lol\n\n\nSo far I&#039;ve done the following:\n\n- booked Moon Palace and have had about 25 ppl book as well (sent out a paperless post save the date and also a website)\n\n- been liaising with such an awesome off-site coordinator who has great input on a lot of things\n\n- booked our photographer, Samuel Luna. I love his style and he is so easy to communicate with, very responsive!\n\n- finalizing decor and bouquets for both ceremony and reception with LatinAsia\n\n- found my dream dress. Went to a store since they were having a sample sale and fell in love with the first dress I tried on. Now I have to make sure I stay the same size for over a year! \n\n- booked Styling Trio for hair and makeup\n\n- bought OOT bags from weddingchicks \n\n\nTo do:\n\n- book a DJ\n\n- find the hubby his wedding attire\n\n- find shoes\n\n- send invites\n\n- find goodies for OOT bags\n\n\n I&#039;m sure there&#039;s more things to do, good thing I still have over a year to go!","Attachments":[],"Id":1881422,"PostDate":1420069397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                January 23, 2016 bride \u263a<br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278146\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278146-thebholders\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TheBHolders<\/span><\/a>, why have you been second guessing your resort? As a fellow Moon Palace bride, I'm here if you need to vent about anything lol<br><br>\nSo far I've done the following:<br>\n- booked Moon Palace and have had about 25 ppl book as well (sent out a paperless post save the date and also a website)<br>\n- been liaising with such an awesome off-site coordinator who has great input on a lot of things<br>\n- booked our photographer, Samuel Luna. I love his style and he is so easy to communicate with, very responsive!<br>\n- finalizing decor and bouquets for both ceremony and reception with LatinAsia<br>\n- found my dream dress. Went to a store since they were having a sample sale and fell in love with the first dress I tried on. Now I have to make sure I stay the same size for over a year! <br>\n- booked Styling Trio for hair and makeup<br>\n- bought OOT bags from weddingchicks <br><br>\nTo do:<br>\n- book a DJ<br>\n- find the hubby his wedding attire<br>\n- find shoes<br>\n- send invites<br>\n- find goodies for OOT bags<br><br>\n I'm sure there's more things to do, good thing I still have over a year to go!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78519","Title":"2016 Brides! Let's Wait In Here!","LastPostDate":1434430646},"Pages":{"TotalItems":57,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":4,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
